OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after being hit by a
OL,4,Acar on rural road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died after being hit by a
OL,7,Fcar on a rural road in West Yorkshire.
OL,9,FThe 52-year-old woman was struck by the
OL,10,Fvehicle in Kebs Road, north of
OL,11,FTodmorden, at around 05:40 BST on
OL,12,FTuesday. She was pronounced dead at the
OL,13,Fscene.
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police said a
OL,16,F68-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,18,Fdriving.
OL,20,FOfficers have appealed for witnesses
OL,21,Fand said a scene remains in place on
OL,22,Fthe road while inquiries are made.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
